WEBVTT

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:32.113
as if you do the actions.

00:03:32.137 --> 00:03:36.109
It looks like this is the leading
edge in terms of rehabilitation.

00:03:36.133 --> 00:03:39.961
But one day we found that Mario

00:03:39.985 --> 00:03:43.336
was not looking at our hand.

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:45.910
He was looking at us.

00:03:45.934 --> 00:03:48.105
We were his mirror.

00:03:48.129 --> 00:03:50.153
And the problem, as you might feel,

00:03:50.177 --> 00:03:52.598
is that we were down, we were depressed,

00:03:52.622 --> 00:03:54.970
we were looking at him as a problem,

00:03:54.994 --> 00:03:59.475
not as a son, not
from a positive perspective.

00:03:59.499 --> 00:04:02.715
And that day really
changed our perspective.